# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NSD / neural data: never commit. The NSD Terms of Use forbid redistributing
# betas or masks, and these files are large and regenerable anyway.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
nsd_cache/
coco_cache/
*.hdf5
*.h5
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.mat
*.part
w2c.*

# Derived arrays (regenerable; large). The per-image targets in data/ are ~136 MB
# and are derived from the NSD/COCO stimuli, so they stay out.
*.npy
*.npz

# ...but the per-participant decoding summaries are ~220 KB in total and contain
# only derived R² values (no NSD data, no local paths). The manuscript's data
# availability statement promises them, and PROVENANCE.md maps every reported
# number onto them, so they are version-controlled.
!roi_*_summary.npy
!reliability_*_summary.npy
!ncsnr_*_ncsnr.npy

# Editor and office temporaries (LibreOffice leaves both while a file is open).
*.tmp
.~lock.*#

# Regenerable output figures the decoding scripts write to the repo ROOT
# (roi_*.png, reliability_*.png, ncsnr_*.png, ...). The Quarto site's assets in
# figures/ ARE version-controlled and are deliberately NOT ignored.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.pdf

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Backups & Quarto build output
*.bak
_site/

# Quarto scratch output
_article.md
_convert.md

# Generated preview images written by view_synthetic / reconstruct
figures/synth_*.png
figures/*_preview.png

# Manuscript sources and the scripts that build them are not published; the
# preprint is linked instead. The builders live in the repo directory so they
# sit beside the summary .npy files they read, but they are never committed.
# build_stats_table.py is public, since it generates a reported table.
*.docx
count_words.py
build_manuscript*
build_supplement*

# Spin-off project with its own git repository; kept out so the two histories
# stay independent.
color-real-or-inferred/

# Private working notes: drafting scaffolding, internal verification records
# and unpublished ideas. Not part of the reproducibility record, which is the
# pipeline, the summary arrays, the test suites and PROVENANCE.md.
CITATIONS_VERIFIED.md
STATS_AUDIT.md
